-# install-it
+# frontend — install-it UI
 
-This template should help get you started developing with Vue 3 in Vite.
+Vue 3 + TypeScript frontend for the install-it Wails desktop app. This is a
+Wails-managed frontend, not a standalone Vite app: the Go backend bindings
+under `wailsjs/` are generated by Wails.
 
-## Recommended IDE Setup
+## Development
 
-[VSCode](https://code.visualstudio.com/) + [Volar](https://marketplace.visualstudio.com/items?itemName=Vue.volar) (and disable Vetur).
-
-## Type Support for `.vue` Imports in TS
-
-TypeScript cannot handle type information for `.vue` imports by default, so we replace the `tsc` CLI with `vue-tsc` for type checking. In editors, we need [Volar](https://marketplace.visualstudio.com/items?itemName=Vue.volar) to make the TypeScript language service aware of `.vue` types.
-
-## Customize configuration
-
-See [Vite Configuration Reference](https://vite.dev/config/).
-
-## Project Setup
+Run from the repository root so the Wails runtime and generated bindings are
+available:
 
 ```sh
-npm install
+wails dev
 ```
 
-### Compile and Hot-Reload for Development
-
-```sh
-npm run dev
-```
+`npm run dev` alone starts Vite without the Wails bridge and will not work
+standalone.
 
-### Type-Check, Compile and Minify for Production
+## Scripts
 
-```sh
-npm run build
-```
+| Command              | Purpose                                   |
+| -------------------- | ----------------------------------------- |
+| `npm install`        | Install dependencies                      |
+| `npm run dev`        | Vite dev server (use `wails dev` instead) |
+| `npm run build`      | Production build + type-check             |
+| `npm run type-check` | `vue-tsc` type-check                      |
+| `npm run lint`       | ESLint                                    |
+| `npm run format`     | Prettier (writes `src/`)                  |
+| `npm test`           | Vitest unit tests (see `src/__tests__/`)  |
 
-### Lint with [ESLint](https://eslint.org/)
+## Conventions
 
-```sh
-npm run lint
-```
+- Vue/TypeScript coding conventions: [STYLE.md](../STYLE.md)
+- Agent instructions, commands, repository map: [AGENTS.md](../AGENTS.md)
+- Do not hand-edit `wailsjs/` — regenerated by `wails dev` / `wails build`.
